    "description": "The Telecom SIM Activation API enables users to seamlessly activate SIM cards within the telecommunications network. This API facilitates the activation process by allowing service providers to submit requests for individual or bulk SIM activations. Typical consumers of this API include telecom operators and service administration teams who need to efficiently manage SIM activations for their customers. By integrating this API, businesses can enhance customer satisfaction through prompt activation services.",
